24,0 $ Cap 2.5-4 cm across, conspicuously wrinkled over the center (at least when young) but otherwise smooth, pinkish to pinkish gray when young but sometimes fading to white, the margin finely lined; found on the wood of hardwoods in the Great Lakes region, possibly elsewhere. $ Pluteus pallidus
24,25 $ Not completely as above.(not : Cap 2.5-4 cm across, conspicuously wrinkled over the center (at least when young) but otherwise smooth, pinkish to pinkish gray when young but sometimes fading to white, the margin finely lined)
